# Repo files that are not site pages. Cloudflare Pages serves everything in the output
# directory, so these are sent away explicitly.
#
# NOTE: _redirects only supports 3xx status codes. An earlier version used `404` and was
# silently ignored — the files kept returning 200 and the rules looked correct in the file.
# Verified empirically against the live pages.dev before and after.
#
# This is defence in depth, NOT the control. The repo is public on GitHub either way, so
# the real rule is: no client confidences in tracked files. See CLAUDE.md.
/CLAUDE.md    /  301
/README.md    /  301
/scripts/*    /  301
